        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-xl text-vulcan-300 ">
          To secure the next purchase, you need to reach the right people with the right content at the right time. Integrate 99minds with Klaviyo and send personalized emails and texts when a customer performs certain actions
          See your loyalty program members’ individual buying behavior and create trigger-based emails and texts to power win-back and retention flows. For example, create a trigger for customers who haven’t visited your store for two months, then automatically send them rewards or gift cards available messages to give them a reason to come back.
